.TH LICH\-MCP 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
lich\-mcp \- Serve the Lich red\-team tools over MCP stdio behind the Champion gate, confined to local sandboxes.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lich\-mcp
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
[COMMAND]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the Lich red\-team tools over MCP stdio behind the Champion gate, confined to local sandboxes.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B confirm
out\-of\-band approval CLI for gated tool calls
.TP
.B drive
drive the server from Claude
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fISTRING\fR
path to the Lich MCP server policy (scope, limits, kill switch) (default configs/lich\-mcp.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-emitted\-by \fISTRING\fR
audit identity for the caller driving these tools (default lich\-mcp/stdio)
.TP
.B \-\-project\-root \fISTRING\fR
checkout root; defaults to $PWD
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
lich\-mcp \-\-config configs/lich\-mcp.yaml
lich\-mcp confirm \-\-help
lich\-mcp drive \-\-help
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
